<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark light">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#121215" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)">
    <title>{{ site.title }}</title>
    <meta name="description" content="{{ site.description }}">
    <link rel="canonical" href="{{ site.url }}">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="{{ "/assets/icon.png" | url }}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ "/assets/styles.css" | url }}">
    <link rel="preload" href="{{ "/assets/fonts/BuilderSans-Regular.woff2" | url }}" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
    <link rel="preload" href="{{ "/assets/fonts/BuilderSans-SemiBold.woff2" | url }}" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
    <link rel="preload" href="{{ "/assets/fonts/BuilderIcons-Subset.woff2" | url }}" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
    <script type="module" src="{{ "/assets/demo.js" | url }}"></script>
    <meta property="og:type" content="website">
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="Studio Discover">
    <meta property="og:title" content="{{ site.title }}">
    <meta property="og:description" content="{{ site.description }}">
    <meta property="og:url" content="{{ site.url }}">
    <meta property="og:image" content="{{ site.url }}assets/og.png">
    <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200">
    <meta property="og:image:height" content="630">
    <meta property="og:image:alt" content="Studio Discover showing the packages installed in a place, beside the headline Your package manager. Right inside Studio.">
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="inner header-row">
        <a class="brand" href="{{ "/" | url }}">
          <img src="{{ "/assets/icon.png" | url }}" alt="" width="32" height="32">
          <span>Studio Discover</span>
        </a>
        <a class="github" href="{{ site.github }}" aria-label="Studio Discover on GitHub">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27s1.36.09 2 .27c1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.013 8.013 0 0 0 16 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8Z" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a class="primary small" href="{{ site.creatorStore }}">Get the plugin</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="main">
      <section class="hero inner" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
        <h1 id="hero-heading">Your package manager.<br>Right inside Studio.</h1>
        <p class="subline">Browse and install Wally and pesde packages in the place you have open. Dependencies and types come with them.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="primary" href="{{ site.creatorStore }}">Get Studio Discover <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="{{ site.github }}">View on GitHub</a>
        </div>
        <p class="proof">Free on the Creator Store. No terminal, no Rokit, no repository setup.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="stage inner" aria-label="Demo">
        <p class="visually-hidden">A demonstration of Studio Discover. It browses Wally, docks to a narrow width, switches to Installed through the title menu, updates two packages, switches to the light theme, and widens again.</p>
        <div class="frame" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="scale">{% include "demo.njk" %}</div>
        </div>
        <p class="caption">Every install can be undone with Ctrl+Z.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="features inner" aria-label="What it does">
        <div>
          <h2>Wally and pesde, side by side.</h2>
          <p>Search both registries from one box, or browse each on its own. Packages from both land in the same place, with the folders each one expects.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>Fits wherever you dock it.</h2>
          <p>Docked at 306px or spread across a second monitor, Discover lays itself out for the space it has, and follows Studio's light and dark themes.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>Updates in one click.</h2>
          <p>Installed packages show when a newer version is out. Update one, or all of them, and Discover warns you before a major version that might need code changes.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>Every install can be undone.</h2>
          <p>Discover writes the whole tree in one Studio change, so Ctrl+Z takes an install back out. If anything fails partway, nothing is left half-applied.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="sources inner" aria-labelledby="sources-heading">
        <h2 class="small-heading" id="sources-heading">Works with the registries you already use</h2>
        <div class="source-list">
          <a class="source" href="https://wally.run">
            <img src="{{ "/assets/wally.png" | url }}" alt="" width="40" height="40">
            <span><b>Wally</b><span>by Uplift Games</span></span>
          </a>
          <a class="source" href="https://pesde.dev">
            <img src="{{ "/assets/pesde.png" | url }}" alt="" width="40" height="40">
            <span><b>pesde</b><span>by daimond113</span></span>
          </a>
          <a class="source" href="https://quenty.github.io/NevermoreEngine/">
            <img src="{{ "/assets/nevermore.png" | url }}" alt="" width="40" height="40">
            <span><b>Nevermore</b><span>by Quenty</span></span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="how inner" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
        <h2 class="small-heading" id="how-heading">How it works</h2>
        <ol>
          <li><h3>Find a package.</h3><p>Search every source, or browse one.</p></li>
          <li><h3>Pick a version.</h3><p>Discover resolves the dependency graph in Studio, with no external tools.</p></li>
          <li><h3>Install.</h3><p>The package, its dependencies, and its types are written into your place in one undoable change.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="get-started inner" aria-labelledby="get-started-heading">
        <h2 id="get-started-heading">Open Studio. Find your next package.</h2>
        <a class="primary" href="{{ site.creatorStore }}">Get Studio Discover <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div class="inner footer-row">
        <span>Studio Discover</span>
        <nav aria-label="Project links">
          <a href="{{ site.github }}">Source</a>
          <a href="{{ site.github }}/releases">Releases</a>
          <a href="{{ "/assets/fonts/LICENSE.txt" | url }}">Font license</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
